{
  "_readme": [
    "Curated IMF references to PIMAs that the Infrastructure Governance portal does not show (or shows only as 'unpublished').",
    "Kinds: 'tar' = a full Technical Assistance Report on imf.org (series Technical Assistance Reports or Country Reports) -> status published, report = pdf;",
    "'hls' = an IMF High-Level Summary Technical Assistance Report (the published product for many missions since 2023) -> status summary (grey star);",
    "'mention' = a PIMA referred to in another IMF publication (e.g. an Article IV staff report) with no PIMA report at all -> status summary.",
    "imf.org cannot be crawled by the server-side refresh (bot protection), so this list is maintained by hand / by the agentic review",
    "and applied on every refresh: a matching portal row (same country and assessment type within one year) gets the reference and status;",
    "otherwise a row is created with source 'imf.org' (tar/hls) or 'manual' (mention). A published status is never downgraded.",
    "Fields: iso3, type (PIMA | PIMA Update | C-PIMA | PIMA follow-up), year, month (publication/reference month), kind (tar | hls | mention), url (page), pdf (report file, tar only), title, note."
  ],
